## SQ-CPP-01 | mixin and tag checks, tags, Common config pack values
@group A (full pack)
@commands boot; `grep -E "Mixin apply failed\|InvalidMixinException\|outside the tested range\|ClassNotFoundException.*(creativecommon\|creativeengineering)" logs/latest.log`; `grep -c "Failed to load tag\|Couldn't load tag" logs/latest.log`; `/zq itemtag creativecommon:metal_dusts`, `creativecommon:bark` (KubeJS 1902 has no `/kubejs dump_tag`); `grep -n "removed\|overrides" config/creativecommon-common.toml \| cut -c1-80`
@pass no mixin errors; no tag load failures except creategoggles' Mekanism reference (third party); metal_dusts lists the IE dusts and zinc grit, bark lists the Immersive Weathering barks (as the old `creativeengineering:bark`; no FD tree bark); the config still holds the removed effects (3 plus `alexsmobs:fear`, N22) and the name list
@fails mixin or tag file moves, config defaults
@reviewed 2026-11-16
@from batches/r1108cge/b1_full.qb
bootreject ClassNotFoundException.*(creativecommon|creativeengineering)
> cdevtest tag item creativecommon:metal_dusts
> cdevtest tag item creativecommon:bark
# judge-6, 2026-11-18: wait for the answers (r1118: the probe /reload was still running, both lines landed in SQ-CPP-02's log)
waitlog verb=tag kind=item tag=creativecommon:bark n= 60
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=creativecommon:metal_dusts .*immersiveengineering:dust_
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=creativecommon:bark n=[1-9]
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0
shell grep -c "Failed to load tag\|Couldn't load tag" logs/latest.log; true
shell grep -n "removed\|overrides" config/creativecommon-common.toml | cut -c1-100
look metal_dusts lists IE dusts and zinc grit; bark lists IW barks; no tag load failure except creategoggles' `mekanism:mekasuit_helmet` (third party, Mekanism not installed); config holds the removed effects (3 plus `alexsmobs:fear`, N22) and the name list

## SQ-CPP-02 | sequenced assembly keeps enchantments and name; potion recipes load
@group A (same boot)
@commands `/zq rdetail` on a felsic or echo assembly; feed an enchanted, renamed netherite chestplate through the sequenced assembly with a fake player / deployer rig, or `/zq` the result NBT; `/zq rdetail creativebrewing:lingerification/` one id and an IE bottling `creativebrewing:iebottling/create_potion/` id
@pass result keeps enchantments and name; the potion recipes load (input shows the potion fluid with `{Bottle, Potion}`)
@fails Engineering mixin gating (create range)
@from batches/r1108cge/b1_full.qb
> zsa creativeequipment:createsequencedassembly/echo_shovel_sequenced_assembly
waitlog \[zsa\] done 20
> zsa selftest
waitlog \[zsa\] done 60
look result keeps Unbreaking III and the name; selftest 0 fail

## SQ-CPP-03 | IE bottling and refinery potion recipes
@group A (same boot)
@commands fill an IE Bottling Machine with a Create potion fluid (Spout-made swiftness), glass bottle in; and the Refinery with splash potion + dragon's breath fluid
@pass a swiftness potion comes out; lingering potion fluid comes out
@fails `FluidTagInputMixin` in Engineering, exact NBT in Brewing
@from batches/r1108cge/b1_full.qb
> zsa bottle minecraft:swiftness
waitlog \[zsa\] done 20
> zsa refine minecraft:swiftness
waitlog \[zsa\] done 20
look bottling REGULAR swiftness -> creativebrewing:iebottling/create_potion/minecraft_swiftness_regular; refinery -> lingering

## SQ-CPP-04 | Brewing's IE potion recipes load and work without Engineering
@group B (chain, CEPortTesting)
@commands Common + Compat + Delight + Brewing (no Engineering), with Create, IE, Fruits Delight; boot; `grep -E "Error parsing recipe\|iebottling\|lingerification" logs/latest.log \| head`; repeat SQ-CPP-03's bottling
@pass boots; Brewing's IE potion recipes load and work without Engineering
@fails Brewing still relies on the subset match
@reviewed 2026-11-16
@from batches/r1108cge/b6_chain.qb
@modset cpp_chain chain
bootreject Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException
bootreject Expected cookingtime
bootexpect Done \(
> zsa bottle minecraft:swiftness
waitlog \[zsa\] done 20
expect bottle recipe creativebrewing:iebottling/create_potion/minecraft_swiftness_regular
shell grep -c "Error parsing recipe" logs/latest.log || true
shell grep -c "creativebrewing:iebottling/create_potion/" logs/latest.log || true
shell grep -cE "\[ERROR\]" logs/kubejs/server.log; true
shell grep -E "\[ERROR\]" logs/kubejs/server.log | cut -c1-220 | head -30
look 0 parse errors naming creativebrewing; swiftness bottles; KubeJS ERRORs = r1107cc's 23 known Delight / Brewing findings (TODO creativebrewing/publish #24, #25) and nothing new

## SQ-CPP-05 | the physics tags load without Create Recycle; no error naming create:scrap_*
@group B (chain)
@commands Common alone plus Compat, without Create Recycle (`create_crush_everything`): boot; `grep -E "scrap_wood\|scrap_copper\|floats\|to_ash" logs/latest.log logs/kubejs/server.log \| grep -iE "error\|missing" \| head`
@pass the physics tags load; no error naming `create:scrap_*`
@fails Compat guard in `item_physics_tags.js`
@reviewed 2026-11-16
@from batches/r1108cge/b7_compat.qb
@modset cpp_chain compat
bootreject Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException
bootreject ^(?!.*Error loading class).*(ClassNotFoundException|NoClassDefFoundError)
bootexpect Done \(
shell grep -E "scrap_wood|scrap_copper|floats|to_ash" logs/latest.log logs/kubejs/server.log | grep -iE "error|missing" | head || true
shell grep -cE "\[ERROR\]" logs/kubejs/server.log logs/kubejs/startup.log || true
shell grep -E "\[ERROR\]" logs/kubejs/server.log logs/kubejs/startup.log | grep -v zz_cl_probe | cut -c1-220 | head || true
> cdevtest tag item creativecompat:physics/floats
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=creativecompat:physics/floats n=[1-9]
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0
look no scrap error (the floats tag moved to creativecompat: since the row was written, SQ-CGE-12); 0 KubeJS errors apart from the scratch-only zz_cl_probe; startup order creativecommon, creativecompat, startup_scripts

## CQ-CPP-01
@group client (full pack)
@commands JEI: hover a drink fluid (apple cider, a Central Kitchen tea) in the ingredient list; Mods screen, Creative Common and Creative Engineering descriptions; load a world (tip bar); `grep "Loading tips:" logs/latest.log`; stand by an open pipe spilling Builder's Tea
@pass effect lines under the fluid name; new descriptions; tips still include the Creative Tips lines (count as before: 2 files); Haste icon shows
@fails DrinkFluidEffects listener / JEI gate, kubejs assets tips
@reviewed 2026-11-24
# steps written r1124gate 2026-11-24 (runner-4): single-player full-pack capture client (`run_captures.py serve`, the run's
# usual unlisted-jar --drop set). qrerun counted this row as draft only for its `@draft` line (no steps since 2026-11-07).
# Builder's Tea pipe after SQ-JFP-01's pump build: tank, pump east, cogwheel and creative motor above, an open pipe end at x 3.
# The JEI fluid hover has no driver step (fluid ingredients are not item tooltips): owner LOOK on a shot.
bootexpect Loading tips: [0-9]+ tips from 2 files
bootreject Loading tips: skipped|Loading tips: built-in pack .* is missing
shell grep "Loading tips:" logs/latest.log | cut -c1-200
shell for j in mods/creativecommon-*.jar mods/creativeengineering-*.jar; do echo "== $j"; unzip -p "$j" META-INF/mods.toml | grep -A2 "^description" | cut -c1-400; done
do {"screen": "jei_uses:farmersdelight:apple_cider"}
do {"wait": "jei"}
do {"wait": 20}
shot jei_apple_cider
do {"screen": "close"}
> effect clear @s
> gamemode survival @s
> fill -1 -60 3 6 -58 7 minecraft:air
> setblock 0 -60 5 create:fluid_tank
sleep 2
> data merge block 0 -60 5 {TankContent:{FluidName:"create:tea",Amount:8000}}
> setblock 2 -60 5 create:fluid_pipe[east=true,west=true]
> setblock 1 -60 5 create:mechanical_pump[facing=east]
> setblock 1 -59 5 create:cogwheel[axis=x]
> setblock 0 -59 5 create:creative_motor[facing=east]{ScrollValue:64}
> setblock 1 -60 5 create:mechanical_pump[facing=east]
do {"look": {"from": "4 -60 5", "yaw": 90, "pitch": 10}}
do {"fly": false}
do {"wait": 200}
> data get block 0 -60 5 TankContent
do {"effects": true, "expect": "minecraft:haste"}
shot tea_pipe_hud
do {"screen": "inventory"}
do {"wait": 10}
shot tea_pipe_inventory
do {"screen": "close"}
> gamemode creative @s
reject Unknown block type|Invalid block state|Incorrect argument|Unknown or incomplete command
look jei_apple_cider: owner hovers or reads the cider fluid's tooltip (effect lines under the fluid name; not automated); descriptions (shell): Common and Engineering texts as in their gradle.properties; tips line counts 2 files; tea_pipe_hud: the Haste icon on the HUD while the open pipe spills tea (tank amount falling in `data get`)
